- critique quality review memo shape
- adaptation promotion review memo shape
- route-quality scorecard shape
- coding benchmark scenario memo shape
- benchmark execution report shape
- replay suite verdict memo shape
- context failure taxonomy memo shape
- critique utility scorecard shape
